window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-024-7294d2448a5ab968.json"]={sha256:"7294d2448a5ab96893ee70874f935763da162ac441f5284ecd34bad2139d1b5d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-e29b871843904d5c","url":"https://research.ibm.com/publications/a-cryo-cmos-control-system-for-large-scale-superconducting-qubit-quantum-computing-part-2","title":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","titleEn":"A Cryo-CMOS Control System for Large-Scale Superconducting Qubit Quantum Computing: Part 2","publisher":"IBM Research","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-024","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-024","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-025","referenceUrls":["https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes"],"title":"Google 校準監測：頻率漂移與重新校準間隔","titleEn":"Google calibration monitoring: frequency drift and recalibration interval","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付秒／週期／角度換算鏈與固定延遲／隨機抖動分類。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver time/cycle/angle conversions and fixed-delay/random-jitter classification. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『Google 校準監測：頻率漂移與重新校準間隔』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付漂移斜率、相位界線與校準／工作時間圖。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'Google calibration monitoring: frequency drift and recalibration interval', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver drift slope, phase limits and calibration/work timelines.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：小時間抖動σt造成相位RMS σφ=2πfσt；只描述參考頻率上的小訊號抖動，不是總門誤差。 使用教學載波f=5 GHz、σt=1 ps；相位以rad量化。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*5e9*1e-12，另開一欄執行獨立核對：直接計算fσt的週期比例再乘360°；兩種路徑的角度應一致。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：線性漂移Δf=rt在固定門窗τ形成φ=2πrtτ；僅為短時間預測，突跳或隨機漫步需其他模型。 使用教學漂移r=2 kHz/min，校準後t=10 min，τ=1 μs。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*2000*10*1e-6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：以0、2、4 min三個合成頻率點確認斜率；外插10 min前查線性殘差。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Small timing jitter σt gives RMS phase σφ=2πfσt; this is a small-signal clock contribution, not total gate error. Use Teaching carrier f=5 GHz and σt=1 ps; express phase in rad. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*5e9*1e-12 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Compute fractional cycle fσt then multiply by360°; both calculation routes should agree.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Linear drift Δf=rt produces φ=2πrtτ in fixed gate window τ; this short-term model excludes jumps and random walks. Use Teaching drift r=2 kHz/min, elapsed t=10 min and τ=1 μs. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*2000*10*1e-6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Use synthetic0,2,4 min frequencies to confirm slope; inspect linear residuals before extrapolating to10 min.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-034","referenceUrls":["https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware"],"title":"IonQ 糾纏門：運動相空間閉合時間","titleEn":"IonQ entangling gates: motional phase-space closure time","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：逐項標記通過、失敗或資料不足，不以熟悉品牌代替證據。最終交接必須包括：交付秒／週期／角度換算鏈與固定延遲／隨機抖動分類。 所有通過結論只在本課明列假設內成立。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Mark each item pass, fail or insufficient evidence; a familiar brand is not proof. Final handover must include: Deliver time/cycle/angle conversions and fixed-delay/random-jitter classification. Every pass remains conditional on the stated teaching assumptions.","difference":"建立『IonQ 糾纏門：運動相空間閉合時間』可核算的名義與變更模型，區分實際來源背景、合成輸入及驗收證據。成果：交付相空間迴圈、閉合殘差與幾何相位待驗清單。","differenceEn":"Build reproducible nominal and changed models for 'IonQ entangling gates: motional phase-space closure time', separating sourced context, synthetic inputs and acceptance evidence. Outcome: Deliver phase-space loops, closure residuals and unverified geometric-phase requirements.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：小時間抖動σt造成相位RMS σφ=2πfσt；只描述參考頻率上的小訊號抖動，不是總門誤差。 使用教學載波f=5 GHz、σt=1 ps；相位以rad量化。 以手算或試算表計算名義式2*pi*5e9*1e-12，另開一欄執行獨立核對：直接計算fσt的週期比例再乘360°；兩種路徑的角度應一致。","先從模型逐項推導，標記量綱與近似：單模式驅動的相空間迴圈在δt=2π時閉合；δ為rad/s。閉合本身不保證正確糾纏相位。 使用教學失諧δ/(2π)=20 kHz；以μs求一圈時間，排除其他模式。 以手算或試算表計算名義式1/20e3*1e6，另開一欄執行獨立核對：用exp(iδt)的cos與sin分量驗證終點(1,0)；另列需調整的力幅度以維持幾何相位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: Small timing jitter σt gives RMS phase σφ=2πfσt; this is a small-signal clock contribution, not total gate error. Use Teaching carrier f=5 GHz and σt=1 ps; express phase in rad. Evaluate nominal expression 2*pi*5e9*1e-12 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Compute fractional cycle fσt then multiply by360°; both calculation routes should agree.","Derive each term, marking dimensions and approximations: A single-mode driven phase-space loop closes when δt=2π, with δ in rad/s; closure alone does not guarantee the desired entangling phase. Use Teaching detuning δ/(2π)=20 kHz; solve one-loop time in μs with other modes excluded. Evaluate nominal expression 1/20e3*1e6 by hand or spreadsheet, then independently check: Check endpoint(1,0) using cos and sin of δt; separately list force-amplitude adjustment needed to preserve geometric phase.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-2edf39976eb0ca17","url":"https://quantumai.google/cirq/tutorials/google/identifying_hardware_changes","title":"Identifying Hardware Changes","titleEn":"Identifying Hardware Changes","publisher":"Google Quantum AI","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-be4f718fe09216f8","url":"https://www.ionq.com/resources/best-practices-for-using-ionq-hardware","title":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","titleEn":"Best Practices for Using IonQ Hardware","publisher":"IonQ","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
